{"1876420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Northward", "steam_appid": 1876420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Northward is an open-world co-op adventure about sailing a scrappy ship through a northern archipelago, exploring the uncharted, finding lost treasure, and uncovering the mystery of a fallen star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain Your Own Vessel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the seas on your very own ship. Find upgrades to go further and furniture to make it more cozy. The occasional adventurer may even want to join your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" aria-label=\"A player steering the ship while another player runs on deck holding a crate.\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries of a Fallen Star...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken dormant magics, uncover the mysteries surrounding a long lost civilization and find a way to return a fallen star to the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Northern Climate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a campfire, cook some newly caught fish, and put on your boots and thick coat as the temperature drops.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Different Biomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb  the highest peaks, dive into the deepest oceans, and beware the leviathans that dwell there. The northern archipelago's various environments will demand preparation and creative solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a scrappy ship through a cold open-world, with up to 3 friends (4 total)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 different biomes, and their unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a non-linear mystery about a fallen star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of different equipment, tools and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and cooking by the campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit characters you come across for your crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leviathan sea-creatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Northward is an open-world co-op adventure about sailing a scrappy ship through a northern archipelago, exploring the uncharted, finding lost treasure, and uncovering the mystery of a fallen star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain Your Own Vessel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the seas on your very own ship. Find upgrades to go further and furniture to make it more cozy. The occasional adventurer may even want to join your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" aria-label=\"A player steering the ship while another player runs on deck holding a crate.\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/16773b6616dbd07ba2108bc7d245e98c.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries of a Fallen Star...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken dormant magics, uncover the mysteries surrounding a long lost civilization and find a way to return a fallen star to the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/2e87c71e6ea3321809648add16af2954.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Northern Climate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a campfire, cook some newly caught fish, and put on your boots and thick coat as the temperature drops.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/88dc8ef17ece75aef384b51183d986d6.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Different Biomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb  the highest peaks, dive into the deepest oceans, and beware the leviathans that dwell there. The northern archipelago's various environments will demand preparation and creative solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.poster.avif?t=1779223526\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.webm?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876420/extras/d02b0773a5a7a43151261ccba81ad3bf.mp4?t=1779223526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a scrappy ship through a cold open-world, with up to 3 friends (4 total)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 different biomes, and their unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a non-linear mystery about a fallen star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of different equipment, tools and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and cooking by the campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customi